Third-party components

This project builds on the tldraw SDK (https://tldraw.dev), which is distributed
under its own license, NOT under this project's Apache-2.0 license. The tldraw
SDK is not open source in the full sense, and its licensing obligations fall on
the party that runs it in production ("downstream"), not on this project.

  - Running only on localhost (the desktop app, `mywb-app://`, or local Docker)
    is treated as development by the SDK and needs no tldraw license key.
  - Deploying to a server with a domain/HTTPS (including internal tools) is
    commercial/production use and requires each operator to obtain their own
    tldraw license (Hobby for non-commercial, commercial otherwise).

This repository ships NO tldraw license key. Self-installers are responsible for
supplying their own key when and if their deployment requires one. See
docs/product-positioning-abstract.md ("Định vị phân phối & license tldraw") for
the full rationale.
